1. A stamp slot is unfilled: `/usr/bin/grep -c -E '_''_''_''_' <your Step-0 copy>` must print **0** (control: the `.pre-stamp` file beside this brief, or a scratch file holding four underscores, prints 1 or more), or the last line is not `READ-WHOLE-BY-TUESDAY: DONE <time> ...`, or `## Stamp` names no launch authority, no hard-stop time or no slot value. A `MOVE-TO-DONE` slot whose launch-authority line does not name the product owner's 2026-11-01 ruling (C-79): treat as `COMMENT-ONLY` and say so.
